      ],
      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The flaw is only reachable when ld.so loads a program with AT_SECURE set, which happens for setuid/setgid or file-capability binaries. The image contains zero setuid, setgid, or file-capability binaries on both amd64 and arm64, and the container runs as uid 65534, so no AT_SECURE exec can occur from image content. Exploitation additionally requires fs.protected_hardlinks to be disabled on the host"
    },
