      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The overflow is only reachable when ld.so processes $ORIGIN for an AT_SECURE (setuid, setgid, or file-capability) program. The image contains zero such binaries on both amd64 and arm64 and runs as uid 65534, so the vulnerable loader path is never executed for image content"
